  "edge_schema": "voltmarkt_edge_pat",
  "prompt": "Yara, from retail operations, is planning each store's staff hours for the four quarters of 2026 and asks how each store's net revenue in 2025 was spread over the quarters. Take the lines of the orders with an order_ts from 2025-01-01 00:00:00 up to but not including 2026-01-01 00:00:00; order_ts holds UTC time, so a quarter is a UTC quarter. A line's net revenue is quantity times unit_price_eur minus line_discount_eur. Return one row for each store with at least one such order, the webshop WEB-01 included, with five columns in this order: store_code; q1_revenue_eur, the store's net revenue from January to March 2025; q2_revenue_eur, from April to June; q3_revenue_eur, from July to September; and q4_revenue_eur, from October to December. A quarter in which the store sold nothing shows 0. Do not round. Sort by store_code from A to Z.",
